OL,3,GNEWSALabour law changes proposed for
OL,4,Atrade deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew employment laws are being proposed
OL,7,Fin Guernsey to help meet international
OL,8,Flabour standards linked to a major
OL,9,Ftrade deal.
OL,11,FThe worker protection laws, which cover
OL,12,Fyoung workers, strike action and trade
OL,13,Funion rights, would help Guernsey
OL,14,Fmaintain its participation in a major
OL,15,FPacific trade agreement.
OL,17,FThe States of Guernsey said the changes
OL,18,Fwere needed for the Comprehensive and
OL,19,FProgressive Agreement for Trans-Pacific
OL,20,FPartnership, a free trade deal with
OL,21,Fcountries including Australia, Canada
OL,22,Fand Japan.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
