OL,3,GNEWSALabour law changes proposed for
OL,4,Atrade deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf approved, the draft laws would
OL,7,Fintroduce minimum working ages, protect
OL,8,Fthe right to strike for non-essential
OL,9,Fservice workers and protect against
OL,10,Fdiscrimination linked to trade union
OL,11,Fmembership.
